{"id":"wb-7-1261","name":"芙蓉楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"芙蓉樓","text":"黔阳芙蓉楼位于湖南省洪江市黔城镇的黔阳古城内，为一处古典园林建筑，为纪念王昌龄而建。背郭临江，依林踞阜，被誉为“楚南上游第一胜迹”。2013年5月，芙蓉楼被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%99%E8%93%89%E6%A8%93","revisionId":86856211,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856211","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/450ec49130ee9fcc2c2c59b4.jpg","title":"芙蓉楼1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8A%99%E8%93%89%E6%A5%BC1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/%E8%8A%99%E8%93%89%E6%A5%BC1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​黔城芙蓉楼。","width":320,"height":213}}